00:28:57,410 --> 00:29:22,950
the 1.2 million dollars allocated for those r d prototypes the 3.5 million required for that comprehensive risk mitigation package every move had a price tag which leads us i think to the final maybe provocative thought for you the listener the ultimate challenge perhaps in the modern professional environment if every single successful strategic move seems to require this level of quantified investment and resource allocation

481
00:29:22,930 --> 00:29:34,570
If the true language of business really is the language of the budget, then what happens to the strategy or the initiative or maybe the part of your professional focus right now that you're struggling to quantify?

