What element of your current work, your goals, are you finding it difficult to assign a hard metric to, a specific ROI, a budgeted cost?

484
00:29:46,030 --> 00:29:57,120
Because the ultimate test in corporate communication, as these dialogues show, might just be forcing the conversation away from vague hopes and aspirations towards that kind of hard, quantified accountability.

485
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:58,340
Something to think about.

486
00:29:58,420 --> 00:29:59,600
Definitely something to think about.

